  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="070df106-062b-522c-92d6-336c5946f6f7" activityNameId="063fff30-c9d6-5fed-8799-b30791475d88" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Capacitor, SMD type, surface-mounting, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Capacitor, SMD type, surface-mounting, at plant
The data represent a typical SMD type capacitor for surface mounting, used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such capacitors and from the literature. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of capacitors with a weight of 0.086 gram/unit. In 2023, only production efforts data are updated, which are explained in separate modules. Furthermore, material and energy input are now represented by global inventory flows; UUID: 9ca934a0-d413-33ba-aedb-c0b2d4685783
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used SMD capacitors for surface mounting technology.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of SMD type capacitors.
Technology: average production of: formulation; build-up process; cutting; bisquing; Pre-Firing; Firing; Tumbling; Termination (SMT) resp. metallization; slitting; winding; metal spray; heat treatment; sawing; lead welding; epoxy filling (THT)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9ca934a0-d413-33ba-aedb-c0b2d4685783.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
